      "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Lethality<>: Executes enemy heroes left at <#e8a800ff>4%<> HP or less after a hit. Hero kills grant <#e8a800ff>10<> stacks, up to <#e8a800ff>80<>. Each stack raises the threshold by <#e8a800ff>0.1%<>. Loses <#e8a800ff>30%<> of the stacks on death."
