      "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Hunter<>: Deals <#e8a800ff>50%<> more damage to monsters. Jungle role only.\n<#ff7a3eff>Greed<>: Monster kills grant <#e8a800ff>8<> bonus gold and restore <#e8a800ff>5%<> maximum HP. Hero kills and assists grant <#e8a800ff>10<> bonus gold.\n<#ff7a3eff>Gorge<>: Monster kills grant <#e8a800ff>0.75%<> more damage per stack, up to <#e8a800ff>15<> stacks.\n<#ff7a3eff>Recharge<>: Hero kills restore <#e8a800ff>12.5%<> maximum HP.\n<#ff7a3eff>Spell Vamp<>: Restore <#e8a800ff>8%<> of enemy HP damage dealt by direct skill hits."
    },
    "raptor_machete": {
      "name": "Raptor Machete",
      "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Hunter<>: Deals <#e8a800ff>50%<> more damage to monsters. Jungle role only.\n<#ff7a3eff>Greed<>: Monster kills grant <#e8a800ff>8<> bonus gold and restore <#e8a800ff>4%<> maximum HP. Hero kills and assists grant <#e8a800ff>10<> bonus gold.\n<#ff7a3eff>Gorge<>: Monster kills grant <#e8a800ff>1.4<> Attack per stack, rounded after stacking, up to <#e8a800ff>15<> stacks.\n<#ff7a3eff>Breakout<>: Every <#e8a800ff>10s<>, a basic attack reduces target Armor by <#e8a800ff>7<> for <#e8a800ff>3s<> and slows by <#e8a800ff>30%<> for <#e8a800ff>1.5s<>. Basic attacks reduce the remaining cooldown by <#e8a800ff>1s<>."
    },
    "mythical_raptor_machete": {
      "name": "Mythical Raptor Machete",
      "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Hunter<>: Deals <#e8a800ff>50%<> more damage to monsters. Jungle role only.\n<#ff7a3eff>Greed<>: Monster kills grant <#e8a800ff>8<> bonus gold and restore <#e8a800ff>5%<> maximum HP. Hero kills and assists grant <#e8a800ff>10<> bonus gold.\n<#ff7a3eff>Gorge<>: Monster kills grant <#e8a800ff>1.75<> Attack per stack, rounded after stacking, up to <#e8a800ff>15<> stacks.\n<#ff7a3eff>Breakout<>: Every <#e8a800ff>10s<>, a basic attack reduces target Armor by <#e8a800ff>9<> for <#e8a800ff>3s<> and slows by <#e8a800ff>30%<> for <#e8a800ff>1.5s<>. Basic attacks reduce the remaining cooldown by <#e8a800ff>1s<>."
    },
    "beast_killer": {
      "name": "Beast Killer",
      "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Hunter<>: Deals <#e8a800ff>50%<> more damage to monsters. Jungle role only.\n<#ff7a3eff>Greed<>: Monster kills grant <#e8a800ff>8<> bonus gold and restore <#e8a800ff>4%<> maximum HP. Hero kills and assists grant <#e8a800ff>10<> bonus gold.\n<#ff7a3eff>Gorge<>: Monster kills grant <#e8a800ff>2.1<> Armor and Magic Resist per stack, rounded after stacking, up to <#e8a800ff>15<> stacks.\n<#ff7a3eff>Impulse<>: Taking damage equal to <#e8a800ff>10%<> maximum HP deals <#e8a800ff>35<> + <#e8a800ff>3<> × level <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to nearby enemies and slows by <#e8a800ff>30%<> for <#e8a800ff>2s<>. Cooldown: <#e8a800ff>2s<>."
