    "mythical_beast_killer": {
      "name": "Mythical Beast Killer",
      "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Hunter<>: Deals <#e8a800ff>50%<> more damage to monsters. Jungle role only.\n<#ff7a3eff>Greed<>: Monster kills grant <#e8a800ff>8<> bonus gold and restore <#e8a800ff>5%<> maximum HP. Hero kills and assists grant <#e8a800ff>10<> bonus gold.\n<#ff7a3eff>Gorge<>: Monster kills grant <#e8a800ff>2.625<> Armor and Magic Resist per stack, rounded after stacking, up to <#e8a800ff>15<> stacks.\n<#ff7a3eff>Impulse<>: Taking damage equal to <#e8a800ff>10%<> maximum HP deals <#e8a800ff>1.25<> × (<#e8a800ff>35<> + <#e8a800ff>3<> × level) <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to nearby enemies and slows by <#e8a800ff>30%<> for <#e8a800ff>2s<>. Cooldown: <#e8a800ff>2s<>."
