      "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Typhoon<>: Basic attacks splash <#a974ffff>magic damage<> equal to <#e8a800ff>50<> + <#e8a800ff>5<> per level to up to <#e8a800ff>3<> enemies. Five basic attacks charge the next basic hit. Shares its cooldown with Windtalker.\n<#ff7a3eff>Activate<>: Typhoon grants <#e8a800ff>10%<> <#92dc7bff>Movement Speed<> for <#e8a800ff>1s<>."
