      "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Recovery<>: After <#e8a800ff>5s<> without taking damage or damaging heroes, restores <#e8a800ff>2.5%<> maximum HP per second.\n<#ff7a3eff>Defender<>: Hits above <#e8a800ff>175<> damage restore (<#e8a800ff>30%<> + <#e8a800ff>0.006%<> × maximum HP) of the excess damage as HP, if the holder survives."
