      "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Holy Blessing<>: Taking <#a974ffff>magic damage<> grants <#e8a800ff>3–10<> Magic Resist, based on level, for <#e8a800ff>5s<>, stacking up to <#e8a800ff>6<> times. Gains a stack at most once every <#e8a800ff>0.4s<>."
