      "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Corrosion<>: Basic attacks deal <#e8a800ff>35<> bonus <#d94c49ff>physical damage<> and slow by <#e8a800ff>8%<> for <#e8a800ff>1.5s<>, stacking up to <#e8a800ff>5<> times. Ranged attackers apply half the slow.\n<#ff7a3eff>Impulse<>: Basic attacks grant <#e8a800ff>6%<> <#92dc7bff>Attack Speed<> for <#e8a800ff>3s<>, stacking up to <#e8a800ff>5<> times. Replaces Swift Crossbow’s Impulse."
